00:32:04.940 --> 00:32:12.890
What the hell's going on?

00:32:12.890 --> 00:32:16.890
Lucky young man to have someone that loves him the way you do.

00:32:16.890 --> 00:32:26.049
Your love was the only thing that I could use to keep Clark out of harm's way.

00:32:26.049 --> 00:32:28.049
And you, close to Lex?

00:32:28.049 --> 00:32:31.049
I don't understand.

00:32:31.049 --> 00:32:32.049
What harm?

00:32:32.049 --> 00:32:36.400
What's Lex doing and why am I a part of it?

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:56.809
I wonder how Martha Ken would handle hearing that you used her son as a bargaining chip.

00:32:56.809 --> 00:33:02.769
Tell me what you know.

00:33:02.769 --> 00:33:11.420
you know.

00:33:11.420 --> 00:33:14.420
You've embraced wholeheartedly what it means to be a loser.

00:33:14.420 --> 00:33:25.710
Chloe, I've x-rayed these tunnels over a dozen times.

00:33:25.710 --> 00:33:27.710
They all just seem to lead to Reeves' dam.

00:33:27.710 --> 00:33:31.710
Maybe so, but if Lex was willing to go up against Toonrider for them,

00:33:31.710 --> 00:33:34.710
I can't retire my reporter's notebook just yet.

00:33:34.710 --> 00:33:37.710
I still don't understand how you thought to come out here.

00:33:37.710 --> 00:33:39.710
Lex said no one knew about those tunnels, not even...

00:33:39.710 --> 00:33:43.170
Lana?

00:33:43.170 --> 00:33:44.170
She led search and rescue out here?

00:33:44.170 --> 00:33:53.880
I guess I had it all wrong.

00:33:53.880 --> 00:33:55.880
This whole time I thought that Lex had forced her into that marriage,

00:33:55.880 --> 00:33:59.000
but...

00:33:59.000 --> 00:34:00.000
No, I don't think he did.

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:02.470
Don't think he did.

00:34:02.470 --> 00:34:07.029
up on your hunch just yet, Claire.

00:34:07.029 --> 00:34:10.030
Lana knew about the other entrance to those tunnels the whole time,

00:34:10.030 --> 00:34:12.030
and it wasn't until she heard you were down there

00:34:12.030 --> 00:34:14.030
that she magically produced them.

00:34:14.030 --> 00:34:19.079
Lana was going to let Lex die down there.

00:34:19.079 --> 00:34:22.079
I think the Luther Mansion is a lot more secrets than we realize.

00:34:22.079 --> 00:34:43.500
The police found this.

00:34:43.500 --> 00:34:46.500
I guess they really wanted to get into it.

00:34:46.500 --> 00:34:51.710
Took it away from them as fast as I could.

00:34:51.710 --> 00:34:54.880
Thank you.

00:34:54.880 --> 00:34:56.880
Well, I'm gonna cuddle up with a movie.

00:34:56.880 --> 00:35:02.880
Any genre preference?

00:35:02.880 --> 00:35:03.880
Okay.

00:35:03.880 --> 00:35:11.289
Well, good night.

00:35:11.289 --> 00:35:14.289
Did you see Clark on our wedding day and tell him you didn't want to marry me?

00:35:14.289 --> 00:35:27.400
Did you?

00:35:27.400 --> 00:35:34.679
Yes, but only because I needed someone to talk to.

00:35:34.679 --> 00:35:39.699
I knew there was something wrong with the baby. I could feel it.

00:35:39.699 --> 00:35:46.380
I thought you wouldn't love me.

00:35:46.380 --> 00:35:58.360
And I didn't want to lie.

00:35:58.360 --> 00:36:00.360
I wanted to say something.

00:36:00.360 --> 00:36:02.360
I did.

00:36:02.360 --> 00:36:07.239
But you loved our baby so much.

00:36:07.239 --> 00:36:15.480
It's one look at our nursery, and I knew that you had an entire life planned.

00:36:15.480 --> 00:36:21.920
Play date.

00:36:21.920 --> 00:36:31.440
We were going to be the best parents in the world.

00:36:31.440 --> 00:36:34.440
But how could I stand at that altar

00:36:34.440 --> 00:36:36.440
in front of all of those people

00:36:36.440 --> 00:36:39.980
and say that everything was going to be okay

00:36:39.980 --> 00:36:41.980
when I knew something was seriously wrong?

00:36:41.980 --> 00:36:47.789
A person would lie like that.

00:36:47.789 --> 00:37:21.440
If someone lied to me like that,

00:37:21.440 --> 00:38:05.360
they would lose my love forever.

00:38:05.360 --> 00:38:07.360
I didn't come in for dinner.

00:38:07.360 --> 00:38:09.360
I thought you might be out hungry.

00:38:09.360 --> 00:38:11.360
I didn't realize how late it was.

00:38:11.360 --> 00:38:16.179
Any idea what Lux and Lyle were doing in those tunnels?

00:38:16.179 --> 00:38:18.179
It just doesn't add up.

00:38:18.179 --> 00:38:19.179
It just doesn't add up.

00:38:19.179 --> 00:38:23.179
Maybe we have budgets, funding, plans, construction.

00:38:23.179 --> 00:38:25.179
It's almost as if Lex was...

00:38:25.179 --> 00:38:29.480
Building a water purification system.

00:38:29.480 --> 00:38:31.480
Maybe this is the one time Lex was actually telling the truth.

00:38:31.480 --> 00:38:38.409
What really happened down there?

00:38:38.409 --> 00:38:42.239
When Lex pulled me out of that rubble,

00:38:42.239 --> 00:38:47.380
I saw a glimpse of something I hadn't seen in years.

00:38:47.380 --> 00:38:52.599
My friend.

00:38:52.599 --> 00:38:56.139
I know you two went through a lot.

00:38:56.139 --> 00:39:02.750
So much has happened.

00:39:02.750 --> 00:39:13.820
Sometimes as hard as it is, you have to let go.

00:39:13.820 --> 00:39:14.820
But you didn't.

00:39:14.820 --> 00:39:19.610
After everything that Lionel's done, you stood by him today.

00:39:19.610 --> 00:39:22.610
That doesn't mean I trust him.

00:39:22.610 --> 00:39:24.610
I wish I could.

00:39:24.610 --> 00:39:28.610
And even though I honestly believe he's made an effort,

00:39:28.610 --> 00:39:31.610
no one can completely change who they are.

00:39:31.610 --> 00:39:33.610
But at least you gave him that chance.

00:39:33.610 --> 00:39:42.980
Mom, what if part of who Lex is?

00:39:42.980 --> 00:39:43.980
It's because of me.

00:39:43.980 --> 00:39:48.000
What if I give up on him too soon?

00:39:48.000 --> 00:39:51.000
You'll never give up on anyone, Clark.

00:39:51.000 --> 00:39:54.000
Because your greatest strength

00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:57.000
might also be your greatest weakness, your hope.

00:39:57.000 --> 00:39:59.599
Your hope.

00:39:59.599 --> 00:40:29.679
I'd be pleased to hear the prototype who's just days from reaching its fullest functioning capacities.

00:40:29.679 --> 00:40:34.219
Thanks to your wife, I almost died for you.

00:40:34.219 --> 00:40:37.219
Let's hope there's nothing you can't do for me.

